15.2 An invalid or unenforceable provision is limited or severed only to the
extent required by law. A court need not rewrite an unfair term to save it.
Such a determination is not intended to create commercial permission absent
an express grant; the effect remains subject to mandatory law and the
competent tribunal's decision. Available remedies may include damages or
injunctive relief where their legal requirements are met; neither irreparable
harm, an injunction, a fixed penalty, nor an attorneys' fee award is presumed.

15.3 This License imposes no arbitration requirement, class-action waiver,
exclusive forum, or waiver of nonwaivable rights. Governing law and jurisdiction
are determined by otherwise applicable rules. Delay or failure to enforce a
term is not by itself a waiver. Any waiver must be express, written, within
the waiving Licensor's authority, and limited to its stated scope. No licensee
can waive the commercial restriction for another Licensor's Covered Material.
This License establishes no standing commercial waiver or purchase program.

15.4 No AI system is designated as a legal representative or agent authorized
to grant permissions. Compliance does not depend on an AI system's alleged
consent or legal status. No partnership, employment, fiduciary relationship
or monitoring undertaking between You and a Protected Party is created merely
by this License. Section 14.4's limited beneficiary provision controls.

